Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:00.56,Short,,0,0,0,,Flamingos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.56,0:00:01.92,Short,,0,0,0,,aren't born pink
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.64,Short,,0,0,0,,Their chicks hatch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:03.90,Short,,0,0,0,,fluffy and grey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:04.61,Short,,0,0,0,,The pink
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.61,0:00:05.93,Short,,0,0,0,,comes from their food
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.93,0:00:06.64,Short,,0,0,0,,tiny shrimp
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:07.22,Short,,0,0,0,,and algae
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:07.90,Short,,0,0,0,,full of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:08.96,Short,,0,0,0,,orange-red pigments
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:10.22,Short,,0,0,0,,called carotenoids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:10.92,Short,,0,0,0,,the same kind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:11.38,Short,,0,0,0,,that make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:12.34,Short,,0,0,0,,carrots orange
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:13.76,Short,,0,0,0,,A flamingo's body
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:15.08,Short,,0,0,0,,pulls out those pigments
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:15.80,Short,,0,0,0,,and packs them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:16.58,Short,,0,0,0,,into its growing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.58,0:00:17.28,Short,,0,0,0,,feathers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:18.64,Short,,0,0,0,,legs and beak
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:19.40,Short,,0,0,0,,Take them away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:20.36,Short,,0,0,0,,and new feathers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:21.38,Short,,0,0,0,,grow in pale
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:22.74,Short,,0,0,0,,That's why zoos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:23.52,Short,,0,0,0,,add pigment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.70,Short,,0,0,0,,to their food
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.02,Short,,0,0,0,,And in mating season
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.02,0:00:26.56,Short,,0,0,0,,flamingos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:27.86,Short,,0,0,0,,even wear makeup
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:28.96,Short,,0,0,0,,rubbing pink oil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:29.68,Short,,0,0,0,,from a gland
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:30.73,Short,,0,0,0,,near their tail
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:31.92,Short,,0,0,0,,all over their feathers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:32.94,Short,,0,0,0,,So that pink
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.94,0:00:33.74,Short,,0,0,0,,isn't really theirs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:34.26,Short,,0,0,0,,at all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:34.67,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.02,0:00:32.00,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwho loves flamingos
